extends layouts/landing

block content
  //- Hero Section
  div(class="relative bg-gray-900 min-h-[80vh] flex items-center justify-center")
    //- Background Image with Overlay
    div(class="absolute inset-0 z-0")
      img(src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Server Room" class="w-full h-full object-cover")
      div(class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900/90 via-gray-900/60 to-gray-900/40")
    
    //- Content Container
    div(class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center")
      div(class="text-white max-w-3xl")
        h1(class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 drop-shadow-md") SILAB
        p(class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-light opacity-90 drop-shadow") Sistem Informasi Inventaris Laboratorium
        
        div(class="mt-10")
          a(href="/login" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg transition-colors text-lg") Masuk ke Sistem

  //- About Section
  section(class="py-20 bg-white")
    div(class="container mx-auto px-6")
      div(class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center")
        h2(class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6") Tentang SILAB
        p(class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed")
          | Sistem Informasi Inventaris Laboratorium (SILAB) adalah platform terintegrasi 
          | untuk mengelola aset, perangkat keras, dan Bahan Habis Pakai (BHP) pada 
          | laboratorium IT. SILAB memudahkan proses peminjaman, pelacakan kondisi barang, 
          | serta pelaporan inventaris secara efisien dan akurat.
